      "role": "user",
      "content": "can u explain what the seller is responsible for under CIF terms in the incoterms 2020 rules? i'm looking at a contract for some electronics shipping from korea to germany and just want to be sure about the transfer of risk vs cost.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
