    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. so if the risk transfers when it's loaded, what happens if something goes wrong during the actual transit across the ocean? if the cargo gets damaged mid-sea, does the buyer handle the claim with the insurance or is the seller still involved in that process?",
